    {
      "_id": "whbLrAmbushShot1",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp",
      "name": "无声伏击",
      "sort": 400000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": { "value": "action" },
        "actions": { "value": 2 },
        "category": "offensive",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>需求</strong> 她相对目标处于隐蔽、躲藏或未被发现</p>\n<p>发动一次<strong>消音狙击</strong>。目标对此次打击措手不及（并触发偷袭）。若命中，她可立刻尝试一次 Hide（不另耗动作），用射击后的硝烟与枝叶掩护。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
