    {
      "_id": "whbLrKiteAway001",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp",
      "name": "抽身远遁",
      "sort": 500000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": { "value": "action" },
        "actions": { "value": 1 },
        "category": "offensive",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>频率</strong> 每轮 1 次；<strong>需求</strong> 本回合她已用远程打击命中，或回合开始时相对至少一个敌人处于隐蔽/躲藏</p>\n<p>Stride。此次移动<strong>不引发</strong>来自她已命中之目标的借机攻击。若结束移动时有掩体或植被，可立刻尝试 Hide。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
