    {
      "_id": "whbLrCultSeed001",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
      "name": "猎人之夜 · 虚无傲慢",
      "sort": 900000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": { "value": "passive" },
        "actions": { "value": null },
        "category": "interaction",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>艾萨克·鲍威尔「猎人之夜」邪教的放逐者。目睹雕塑家扭曲杰作后，她对末日与超自然不再恐惧，只剩冷硬的虚无。</p>\n<p>对抗恐惧、情绪与 demoralize 的意志豁免获得 <strong>+2 状态加值</strong>。她可用 Intimidation 恐吓：口中低语末日预言，失败的敌人获得 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQidQVSrGRTuq]{惊惧 1}（1 轮）。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
          "title": "猎杀对决 — 猎人",
          "authors": "Wang Homebrew / Hunt: Showdown",
          "license": "ORC",
          "remaster": true
        },
        "rules": [],
        "slug": "laura-cult-nihilism",
        "traits": { "value": ["emotion", "fear", "mental", "auditory"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "whbLrTactics0001",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
      "name": "风筝教义（GM）",
      "sort": 950000,
      "type": "action",
      "system": {
        "actionType": { "value": "passive" },
        "actions": { "value": null },
        "category": "offensive",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>典型回合</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>隐蔽处 <strong>无声伏击</strong>（2）→ 偷袭爆头</li>\n<li><strong>抽身远遁</strong>（1）拉开 30～50 尺并再 Hide</li>\n<li>下一轮若需装填：先 <strong>枝影隐没</strong> / Hide，再 <strong>冷静装填</strong>；绝不贴脸硬刚</li>\n</ol>\n<p>理想交战距离 <strong>80～120 尺</strong>。被近身后优先 Step+Stride 拉开，用枪托仅作最后手段。她会放弃击杀也要保持「打一枪就消失」。</p>"
        },
        "publication": {
